{'slug': 'remote-technical-writer-product-engineer-thermal-works-1131481', 'id': '1131481', 'epoch': 1778025705, 'date': '2026-05-06T00:01:45+00:00', 'company': 'Thermal Works', 'company_logo': '', 'position': 'Technical Writer & Product Engineer', 'tags': ['system', 'technical', 'writer', 'growth', 'engineer'], 'description': "Thermal Works LLC has an exciting opportunity for a <strong>Technical Writer &amp; Product Engineer</strong> to join our team, working cross-functionally with Operations, Engineering, Project Management, Manufacturing, and Service teams, supporting documentation needs from product development through submittal creation, manufacturing, installation, and field support. The <strong>Technical Writer &amp; Product Engineer</strong> will own the creation, release, and configuration alignment of technical documentation for complex HVAC and thermal systems used in data center applications. This role plays a critical part in ensuring that product documentation remains technically accurate, revision-controlled, and aligned with released product configurations throughout the product lifecycle.Â\xa0The ideal candidate combines strong technical writing skills with practical knowledge of HVAC systems, mechanical equipment, manufacturing environments, construction workflows, and document/configuration control.

